 nemo_rl/environments/enigmata_environment.py | 431 +++++++++++++++++++
 nemo_rl/environments/utils.py                |   3 +
 3 files changed, 435 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 nemo_rl/environments/enigmata_environment.py

